          <h3 class="super-editor-title">Super Editor</h3>
          <p class="super-editor-summary">Add rich text editing to your Flutter app, from a single chat box to a full document.</p>
          <a href="https://pub.dev/packages/super_editor" target="_blank" class="pub-link">Get Super Editor on pub.dev</a>

          <div class="use-case use-case-documents">
            <h4 class="use-case-title">Documents</h4>
            <div class="use-case-text">
              <p>Build a full document editor for desktop, web and phones. Include headings, images, tasks and quotes, and style all of it to match your app.</p>
              <p class="use-case-packages"><b>attributed_text</b> carries the styles. <b>super_text_layout</b> paints the selection and caret.</p>
              <a href="https://pub.dev/packages/super_editor" target="_blank" class="pub-link">Get Super Editor on pub.dev</a>
            </div>
            <div class="use-case-screens" role="img" aria-label="The same document in a desktop editor in dark mode, a desktop editor in light mode, and a phone editor, with a formatting toolbar, an image, a task list, a quote and a numbered list, along with close-ups of menus for blocks, styles, mentions and links">
              <!-- The same document, with the light window in front of the dark one -->
              {% for theme in ["dark", "light"] %}
              <div class="se-screen se-{{ theme }} se-document">
                <div class="se-bar"><svg><use href="#se-menu"/></svg><span>Trail app</span><span>/</span><b>New trail maps</b><div class="se-bar-end"><span class="se-avatar se-avatar-nadia se-avatar-small">NR</span><span class="se-avatar se-avatar-tom se-avatar-small">TO</span><span class="se-avatar se-avatar-june se-avatar-small">JP</span><span class="se-share">Share</span></div></div>
                <div class="se-sidebar">
                  <div class="se-label">Pages</div>
                  <div class="se-row"><svg><use href="#se-doc"/></svg>Roadmap</div><div class="se-row se-on"><svg><use href="#se-doc"/></svg>New trail maps</div><div class="se-row"><svg><use href="#se-doc"/></svg>Release checklist</div><div class="se-row"><svg><use href="#se-doc"/></svg>Hiker interviews</div>
                  <div class="se-label">Shared</div>
                  <div class="se-row"><svg><use href="#se-doc"/></svg>Design principles</div><div class="se-row"><svg><use href="#se-doc"/></svg>Onboarding</div>
                </div>
                <div class="se-page">
                  <div class="se-heading">New trail maps</div>
                  <div class="se-byline"><span class="se-avatar se-avatar-nadia se-avatar-small">NR</span>Nadia Reyes</div>
                  <p><span class="se-wide-only">A hiker looks down for two seconds. </span>The next turn has to be <span class="se-selection"><b>readable at a glance</b><span class="se-popup se-toolbar"><span class="se-button se-on">B</span><span class="se-button italic">I</span><span class="se-button underline">U</span><span class="se-button line-through">S</span><span class="se-divider"></span><span class="se-button"><svg><use href="#se-link"/></svg></span><span class="se-button"><svg><use href="#se-code"/></svg></span><span class="se-button"><svg><use href="#se-quote"/></svg></span></span></span>, in full sun and at arm’s length.</p>
                  <div class="se-photo"></div>
                  <div class="se-caption">Mesa Loop, the first trail on the new map</div>
                  <div class="se-subheading">What has to work</div>
                  <div class="se-task se-done"><span class="se-checkbox"><svg><use href="#se-check"/></svg></span><span>Show the next turn in large type</span></div>
                  <div class="se-task se-done"><span class="se-checkbox"><svg><use href="#se-check"/></svg></span><span>Keep contrast high in full sun</span></div>
